  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text {Hints: }\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}\n1 & 1 & 6 \\\\\n1 & 3 & -4 \\\\\n1 & x & y\n\\end{array}\\right|=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 1(3 y+4 x)-(y-6 x)+1(-4-18)=0 \\Rightarrow 3 y+4 x-y+6 x-12=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 2 y+10 x-22=0 \\\\\n& y+5 x=11\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
